@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Pierwsze wywołanie: oczekiwane MISS, ok. 3000 ms
POST {{host}}/projections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "1.0",
  "processId": "6785786",
  "list": ["test1", "test2"]
}

### 2. Identyczne żądanie: oczekiwane HIT, kilka ms
POST {{host}}/projections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "1.0",
  "processId": "6785786",
  "list": ["test1", "test2"]
}

### 3. Inna kolejność i wielkość liter aktywów: nadal HIT (klucz kanoniczny)
POST {{host}}/projections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "1.0",
  "processId": "6785786",
  "list": ["test2", "Test1"]
}

### 5. Nowa wersja aplikacji: MISS
POST {{host}}/projections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "1.1",
  "processId": "6785786",
  "list": ["test2", "Test1"]
}

### 7. Inny processId
POST {{host}}/projections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "1.1",
